# Ignore everything
*

# Essential project files
!README.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!Makefile
!install.sh
!LICENSE
!azure-pipelines.yml
!Dockerfile
!.gitignore
!**/GEMINI.md
!**/WORKER.md
!**/FEATURE.md
!**/CLAUDE.md

# Repository Structure Exceptions
!.github/
!.github/**
!.devcontainer/
!.devcontainer/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!opt/
!opt/**
!src/
!src/**

# Local Binary Zone (opt/bin)
# We ignore everything in opt/bin except for the registry documentation and a
# few committed, hand-maintained tools (locally built binaries stay ignored).
opt/bin/*
!opt/bin/GEMINI.md
!opt/bin/CLAUDE.md
!opt/bin/pkg-install
!opt/bin/pkg-install-apt
!opt/bin/pkg-install-brew
!opt/bin/install_windows.sh

# Opt Subdirectory Configuration
opt/.DS_Store
opt/rbenv
opt/XMind_Linux_64bit/
opt/clawdad/
opt/nano/

# Documentation
# docs/ is tracked so guides are available on all machines.
# To keep a doc local-only, list it explicitly below (e.g. docs/my-private-notes.md).
!docs/
!docs/**

# Source Code Build Artifacts
src/tmux-mgr/tmux-mg
coverage/

# System & Local Settings (Always Private)
!system/
!system/**
!ai/
!ai/**
# Per-host Claude/Gemini settings stay local; install.sh seeds them from the
# tracked .template files so each machine can customize without leaking values.
ai/claude/settings.json
.custom_alias
*.swp

# Tool Specific Configurations
!.config/
!.config/terminator/
!.config/terminator/config
